  "description": "Roslyn analyzers for PostQuantum.Jwt: PQJWT001 forbids inspecting JOSE header fields (alg/jwk/jku/x5u/x5c) — the verification key comes from a trusted key ring, never the token — and PQJWT002 flags per-call PqJwtValidator construction. Add with PrivateAssets=\"all\". Production-oriented preview companion package for controlled issuer/verifier systems; not independently audited and not a drop-in OAuth/OIDC replacement.",
